## Notion Blog Addon - Implementation Guide

### Step 1: Database Configuration

Create `settings/database.json` with your Notion database:

```json
{
  "blog": {
    "type": "notion",
    "config": {
      "api_key": "[[env.NOTION_API_KEY]]",
      "database_id": "YOUR_NOTION_DATABASE_ID"
    },
    "schema": {
      "Title": "title",
      "Slug": "rich_text",
      "Description": "rich_text",
      "Author": "rich_text",
      "Image": "files",
      "Published": "checkbox",
      "Created Date": "date",
      "Tags": "multi_select"
    },
    "security": {
      "read": { "level": "public" },
      "create": { "level": "authenticated" },
      "update": { "level": "owner" },
      "delete": { "level": "owner" }
    }
  }
}
```

### Step 2: Blog List Page

Create `pages/blog.json`:

```json
{
  "layout": "main",
  "fetch_data": {
    "blog": {
      "database": "blog",
      "filters": {
        "Published": true
      },
      "sort": {
        "property": "Created Date",
        "direction": "descending"
      }
    }
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "component": "@addons/notion-blog/List",
      "attributes": {
        "database": "blog",
        "postUrl": "/blog/post",
        "layout": {
          "type": "grid",
          "columns": "grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3",
          "gap": "gap-8"
        },
        "header": {
          "title": "Blog"
        },
        "display": {
          "showDate": true,
          "showDescription": true,
          "showImage": true,
          "excerptLength": 120
        },
        "fields": {
          "titleField": "Title",
          "slugField": "Slug",
          "descriptionField": "Description",
          "imageField": "Image"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

### Step 3: Article Page

Create `pages/blog/post/:slug.json`:

```json
{
  "layout": "main",
  "fetch_data": {
    "blog": {
      "database": "blog",
      "fetchType": "page",
      "filters": {
        "Slug": "{{params.slug}}"
      },
      "single": true
    }
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "component": "@addons/notion-blog/Article",
      "attributes": {
        "database": "blog",
        "navigation": {
          "backLink": "/blog",
          "backLabel": "← Back to Blog"
        },
        "display": {
          "showDescription": true,
          "showCoverImage": true
        },
        "share": {
          "enabled": true
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

### Key Points

1. **Simplified filters**: Use `{ "Published": true }` instead of native Notion format - the framework transforms it automatically using the schema
2. **fetchType: "page"**: Required for article pages to fetch Notion blocks (content)
3. **single: true**: Returns single object instead of array
4. **{{params.slug}}**: Template variable replaced with URL parameter
5. **Schema required**: Define field types in database config for filter transformation

